                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">1</hi> These figures refer to the hauling grounds of
                    St. Paul.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">2</hi> These totals include all males killed for any
                    purpose on the islands.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">3</hi> In 1876 the killing was begun at an unusual
                    date, said to be on account of an exceptionally late season.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">4</hi> Closed by order of the agent in charge.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">5</hi> Tears of the modus vivendi.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">6</hi> As reported to date.</p>
